  "notes": "Omnidirectional Soft Sleeve Actuator (4-chamber bellows), FEA parametric-study variant OSSA 5 of 11 (paper's Table 1), all chambers pressurized equally -- axial extend mode. Fig 4 reports independent single-variable quasi-static sweeps per panel, not a joint multi-axis actuation trial of one variant, so this record stays single-channel (k=1) like the v0.1 ossa_axial_extend sibling; it does not exercise the v0.2 Part A multi-input semantics (see build report -- flagged as a scoped deviation from the proposal's 'stress test' framing rather than fabricated). Existing hand-typed ossa_axial_extend.json ('fractions estimated' from the abstract) is left untouched; this record supersedes it in spirit with real digitized curves under a new id."
